## Cookie font

The Buy me a coffee footer in the settings uses the Cookie typeface,
Copyright (c) 2011 by Ania Kruk, with Reserved Font Name Cookie, licensed
under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The latin subset from Fontsource 5.3.0
is kept unmodified in `src/assets/fonts/` next to its licence (`OFL.txt`) and
is inlined into `styles.css` at build time. The plugin refers to it as
_Drive Bridge Script_.

